# KSA Skilled Development — Enterprise Web Portal

## Project Overview

**Project Name:** KSA Skilled Development

**Objective:** Develop a premium Saudi Government inspired enterprise web portal using React.js, Node.js, Express.js and MongoDB.

The UI should take inspiration from these websites only:

- https://mt.gov.sa/
- https://www.hrsd.gov.sa/en

**Never copy any section directly.**

Create an original luxury enterprise design inspired by Saudi Government websites.

The website should look more premium than both reference websites.

The design should feel modern, elegant, trustworthy, government level, corporate and international.

---

