## Important Rules

- Do not generate fake code
- Do not generate placeholder pages
- Every page must be fully designed
- Every page must be connected with backend
- Every form must save data inside MongoDB
- Every module must be production ready
- Every API must work
- Every dashboard must be functional
- Build this project exactly like an enterprise product worth over 600,000 PKR
- The final quality must be equal to or better than enterprise Saudi Government portals

